      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:00.00",
      "end_raw": "00:05.50",
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 5500,
      "text": "Low-angle shot tilting down to a polished mahogany table as a white-gloved servant places a tall stack of wax-sealed wedding invitations onto a silver tray.",
      "line_number": 14,
      "duration_ms": 5500
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP037_B002",
      "episode_id": "EP037",
      "file_index": 1,
      "scene_id": "EP037_S01",
      "block_type": "SOUND_FX",
      "label_raw": "SOUND FX",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:01.50",
      "end_raw": "00:03.20",
      "start_ms": 1500,
      "end_ms": 3200,
      "text": "The crisp tap of heavy cardstock envelopes being set down onto silver.",
      "line_number": 18,
      "duration_ms": 1700
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP037_B003",
      "episode_id": "EP037",
      "file_index": 2,
      "scene_id": "EP037_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:05.50",
      "end_raw": "00:09.50",
      "start_ms": 5500,
      "end_ms": 9500,
      "text": "Medium two-shot framed symmetrically down the vaulted, sunlit hallway. Blond Nobleman Rupert stands tall in a black embroidered frock coat, facing Catherine in an ornate pink gown.",
      "line_number": 22,
      "duration_ms": 4000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP037_B004",
      "episode_id": "EP037",
      "file_index": 3,
      "scene_id": "EP037_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "BLOND NOBLEMAN (Rupert) (Cold, Calculating)",
      "speaker": "BLOND NOBLEMAN",
      "delivery": [
        "Rupert",
        "Cold",
        "Calculating"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:06.00",
      "end_raw": "00:09.30",
      "start_ms": 6000,
      "end_ms": 9300,
      "text": "\"Every important family in the county should witness it.\"",
      "line_number": 26,
      "duration_ms": 3300
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP037_B005",
      "episode_id": "EP037",
      "file_index": 4,
      "scene_id": "EP037_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:09.50",
      "end_raw": "00:12.50",
      "start_ms": 9500,
      "end_ms": 12500,
      "text": "Close-up of Catherine looking down at the invitations, her braided blonde hair immaculately pinned, before she raises her eyes with a slight smirk.",
      "line_number": 30,
      "duration_ms": 3000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP037_B006",
      "episode_id": "EP037",
      "file_index": 5,
      "scene_id": "EP037_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "CATHERINE (Inquiring, Smug)",
      "speaker": "CATHERINE",
      "delivery": [
        "Inquiring",
        "Smug"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:10.80",
      "end_raw": "00:12.40",
      "start_ms": 10800,
      "end_ms": 12400,
      "text": "\"The wedding?\"",
      "line_number": 34,
      "duration_ms": 1600
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP037_B007",
      "episode_id": "EP037",
      "file_index": 6,
      "scene_id": "EP037_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:12.50",
      "end_raw": "00:15.00",
      "start_ms": 12500,
      "end_ms": 15000,
      "text": "Close-up on Rupert, his sharp aristocratic features set in cold conviction.",
      "line_number": 38,
      "duration_ms": 2500
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP037_B008",
      "episode_id": "EP037",
      "file_index": 7,
      "scene_id": "EP037_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "BLOND NOBLEMAN (Rupert) (Authoritative)",
      "speaker": "BLOND NOBLEMAN",
      "delivery": [
        "Rupert",
        "Authoritative"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:12.80",
      "end_raw": "00:14.80",
      "start_ms": 12800,
      "end_ms": 14800,
      "text": "\"The transfer of Ashbridge.\"",
      "line_number": 42,
      "duration_ms": 2000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP037_B009",
      "episode_id": "EP037",
      "file_index": 8,
      "scene_id": "EP037_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:15.00",
      "end_raw": "00:18.80",
      "start_ms": 15000,
      "end_ms": 18800,
      "text": "Medium close-up of Catherine picking up one of the invitations, turning it over in her gloved hands with predatory delight.",
      "line_number": 46,
      "duration_ms": 3800
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP037_B010",
      "episode_id": "EP037",
      "file_index": 9,
      "scene_id": "EP037_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "CATHERINE (Gloating)",
      "speaker": "CATHERINE",
      "delivery": [
        "Gloating"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:15.60",
      "end_raw": "00:18.80",
      "start_ms": 15600,
      "end_ms": 18800,
      "text": "\"After the ceremony, no one will question who owns this house.\"",
      "line_number": 50,
      "duration_ms": 3200
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP037_B011",
      "episode_id": "EP037",
      "file_index": 10,
      "scene_id": "EP037_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:18.80",
      "end_raw": "00:23.20",
      "start_ms": 18800,
      "end_ms": 23200,
      "text": "Intense close-up of Rupert leaning in slightly, his eyes narrowing with venomous malice.",
      "line_number": 54,
      "duration_ms": 4400
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP037_B012",
      "episode_id": "EP037",
      "file_index": 11,
      "scene_id": "EP037_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "BLOND NOBLEMAN (Rupert) (Sinister, Ruthless)",
      "speaker": "BLOND NOBLEMAN",
      "delivery": [
        "Rupert",
        "Sinister",
        "Ruthless"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:19.00",
      "end_raw": "00:23.00",
      "start_ms": 19000,
      "end_ms": 23000,
      "text": "\"And no one will question what happened to the woman who tried to stop us.\"",
      "line_number": 58,
      "duration_ms": 4000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP037_B013",
      "episode_id": "EP037",
      "file_index": 12,
      "scene_id": "EP037_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:23.20",
      "end_raw": "00:26.50",
      "start_ms": 23200,
      "end_ms": 26500,
      "text": "Tight close-up of Catherine as a cruel sneer twists her lips.",
      "line_number": 62,
      "duration_ms": 3300
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP037_B014",
      "episode_id": "EP037",
      "file_index": 13,
      "scene_id": "EP037_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "CATHERINE (Venomous Satisfaction)",
      "speaker": "CATHERINE",
      "delivery": [
        "Venomous Satisfaction"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:23.80",
      "end_raw": "00:26.40",
      "start_ms": 23800,
      "end_ms": 26400,
      "text": "\"Juliana's execution comes after the wedding.\"",
      "line_number": 66,
      "duration_ms": 2600
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP037_B015",
      "episode_id": "EP037",
      "file_index": 14,
      "scene_id": "EP037_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:26.50",
      "end_raw": "00:30.00",
      "start_ms": 26500,
      "end_ms": 30000,
      "text": "Wide shot framing the two conspirators beneath the towering archways of the estate.",
      "line_number": 70,
      "duration_ms": 3500
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP037_B016",
      "episode_id": "EP037",
      "file_index": 15,
      "scene_id": "EP037_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "CATHERINE (Gleeful)",
      "speaker": "CATHERINE",
      "delivery": [
        "Gleeful"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:26.60",
      "end_raw": "00:29.80",
      "start_ms": 26600,
      "end_ms": 29800,
      "text": "\"Perfect timing. It will be a feast for our guests.\"",
      "line_number": 74,
      "duration_ms": 3200
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP037_B017",
      "episode_id": "EP037",
      "file_index": 16,
      "scene_id": "EP037_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:30.00",
      "end_raw": "00:32.50",
      "start_ms": 30000,
      "end_ms": 32500,
      "text": "Medium close-up of Rupert turning his gaze toward the grand entrance.",
      "line_number": 78,
      "duration_ms": 2500
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP037_B018",
      "episode_id": "EP037",
      "file_index": 17,
      "scene_id": "EP037_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "BLOND NOBLEMAN (Rupert) (Decisive)",
      "speaker": "BLOND NOBLEMAN",
      "delivery": [
        "Rupert",
        "Decisive"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:30.20",
      "end_raw": "00:32.20",
      "start_ms": 30200,
      "end_ms": 32200,
      "text": "\"Send the invitations.\"",
      "line_number": 82,
      "duration_ms": 2000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP037_B019",
      "episode_id": "EP037",
      "file_index": 18,
      "scene_id": "EP037_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:32.50",
      "end_raw": "00:34.50",
      "start_ms": 32500,
      "end_ms": 34500,
      "text": "Close-up of Catherine looking sideways with narrowed eyes.",
      "line_number": 86,
      "duration_ms": 2000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP037_B020",
      "episode_id": "EP037",
      "file_index": 19,
      "scene_id": "EP037_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "CATHERINE (Spiteful)",
      "speaker": "CATHERINE",
      "delivery": [
        "Spiteful"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:32.80",
      "end_raw": "00:34.50",
      "start_ms": 32800,
      "end_ms": 34500,
      "text": "\"Especially to the Ashcrofts.\"",
      "line_number": 90,
      "duration_ms": 1700
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP037_B021",
      "episode_id": "EP037",
      "file_index": 20,
      "scene_id": "EP037_S02",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:34.50",
      "end_raw": "00:37.00",
      "start_ms": 34500,
      "end_ms": 37000,
      "text": "Wide tracking shot down a palatial marble hall as a butler carries a silver tray toward double doors.",
      "line_number": 101,
      "duration_ms": 2500
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP037_B022",
      "episode_id": "EP037",
      "file_index": 21,
      "scene_id": "EP037_S02",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:37.00",
      "end_raw": "00:39.80",
      "start_ms": 37000,
      "end_ms": 39800,
      "text": "Medium shot inside an opulent drawing room with a roaring fireplace. Lady Clarissa sits gracefully in an emerald satin gown as the butler presents the tray.",
      "line_number": 105,
      "duration_ms": 2800
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP037_B023",
      "episode_id": "EP037",
      "file_index": 22,
      "scene_id": "EP037_S02",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "BUTLER (Formal)",
      "speaker": "BUTLER",
      "delivery": [
        "Formal"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:37.00",
      "end_raw": "00:39.80",
      "start_ms": 37000,
      "end_ms": 39800,
      "text": "\"Lady Clarissa, an invitation from Ashbridge Manor.\"",
      "line_number": 109,
      "duration_ms": 2800
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP037_B024",
      "episode_id": "EP037",
      "file_index": 23,
      "scene_id": "EP037_S02",
      "block_type": "ACTION",
      "label_raw": "ACTION",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:39.50",
      "end_raw": "00:44.00",
      "start_ms": 39500,
      "end_ms": 44000,
      "text": "Clarissa takes the cream envelope, breaks the red wax seal with her gloved thumbs, and slides out the heavy card.",
      "line_number": 113,
      "duration_ms": 4500
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP037_B025",
      "episode_id": "EP037",
      "file_index": 24,
      "scene_id": "EP037_S02",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:44.00",
      "end_raw": "00:46.80",
      "start_ms": 44000,
      "end_ms": 46800,
      "text": "Close-up of Clarissa's face lighting up with malicious excitement, the warm hearth flickering in the background.",
      "line_number": 117,
      "duration_ms": 2800
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP037_B026",
      "episode_id": "EP037",
      "file_index": 25,
      "scene_id": "EP037_S02",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "LADY CLARISSA (Amused, Thrilled)",
      "speaker": "LADY CLARISSA",
      "delivery": [
        "Amused",
        "Thrilled"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:44.50",
      "end_raw": "00:46.50",
      "start_ms": 44500,
      "end_ms": 46500,
      "text": "\"Catherine's wedding.\"",
      "line_number": 121,
      "duration_ms": 2000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP037_B027",
      "episode_id": "EP037",
      "file_index": 26,
      "scene_id": "EP037_S02",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:46.80",
      "end_raw": "00:49.50",
      "start_ms": 46800,
      "end_ms": 49500,
      "text": "Medium two-shot as her dark-haired husband steps up behind her chair, crossing his arms.",
      "line_number": 125,
      "duration_ms": 2700
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP037_B028",
      "episode_id": "EP037",
      "file_index": 27,
      "scene_id": "EP037_S02",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "NOBLEMAN (Observant)",
      "speaker": "NOBLEMAN",
      "delivery": [
        "Observant"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:47.00",
      "end_raw": "00:49.20",
      "start_ms": 47000,
      "end_ms": 49200,
      "text": "\"So it is finally official.\"",
      "line_number": 129,
      "duration_ms": 2200
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP037_B029",
      "episode_id": "EP037",
      "file_index": 28,
      "scene_id": "EP037_S02",
