      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "02:04.80",
      "end_raw": "02:06.50",
      "start_ms": 124800,
      "end_ms": 126500,
      "text": "\"She was always stubborn.\"",
      "line_number": 307,
      "duration_ms": 1700
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP037_B070",
      "episode_id": "EP037",
      "file_index": 69,
      "scene_id": "EP037_S04",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "02:07.00",
      "end_raw": "02:12.50",
      "start_ms": 127000,
      "end_ms": 132500,
      "text": "Close-up on Clarissa's face hardening with bitter resentment.",
      "line_number": 311,
      "duration_ms": 5500
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP037_B071",
      "episode_id": "EP037",
      "file_index": 70,
      "scene_id": "EP037_S04",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "LADY CLARISSA (Bitter, Cold)",
      "speaker": "LADY CLARISSA",
      "delivery": [
        "Bitter",
        "Cold"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "02:07.50",
      "end_raw": "02:12.00",
      "start_ms": 127500,
      "end_ms": 132000,
      "text": "\"That was her greatest mistake. She could have accepted what happened. She could have disappeared quietly.\"",
      "line_number": 315,
      "duration_ms": 4500
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP037_B072",
      "episode_id": "EP037",
      "file_index": 71,
      "scene_id": "EP037_S04",
      "block_type": "ACTION",
      "label_raw": "ACTION",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "02:12.50",
      "end_raw": "02:16.00",
      "start_ms": 132500,
      "end_ms": 136000,
      "text": "Clarissa rises from her armchair holding a cut crystal glass filled with dark red wine, pacing toward the fireplace.",
      "line_number": 319,
      "duration_ms": 3500
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP037_B073",
      "episode_id": "EP037",
      "file_index": 72,
      "scene_id": "EP037_S04",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "02:12.50",
      "end_raw": "02:21.50",
      "start_ms": 132500,
      "end_ms": 141500,
      "text": "Medium tracking shot showing Clarissa standing tall beside her husband, her posture regal and vindictive.",
      "line_number": 323,
      "duration_ms": 9000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP037_B074",
      "episode_id": "EP037",
      "file_index": 73,
      "scene_id": "EP037_S04",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "LADY CLARISSA (Venomous Monologue)",
      "speaker": "LADY CLARISSA",
      "delivery": [
        "Venomous Monologue"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "02:14.00",
      "end_raw": "02:21.00",
      "start_ms": 134000,
      "end_ms": 141000,
      "text": "\"Instead she married a nobody, played healer to peasants, challenged people above her. And now the whole county will watch her pay for it.\"",
      "line_number": 327,
      "duration_ms": 7000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP037_B075",
      "episode_id": "EP037",
      "file_index": 74,
      "scene_id": "EP037_S04",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "02:21.50",
      "end_raw": "02:27.50",
      "start_ms": 141500,
      "end_ms": 147500,
      "text": "Tight close-up on Clarissa's face glowing in the firelight. Her lips curl into a merciless smile as she lifts the crystal glass to her mouth and drinks.",
      "line_number": 331,
      "duration_ms": 6000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP037_B076",
      "episode_id": "EP037",
      "file_index": 75,
      "scene_id": "EP037_S04",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "LADY CLARISSA (Chilling Proclamation)",
      "speaker": "LADY CLARISSA",
      "delivery": [
        "Chilling Proclamation"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "02:22.50",
      "end_raw": "02:26.50",
      "start_ms": 142500,
      "end_ms": 146500,
      "text": "\"Let them see what happens when a woman forgets her place.\"",
      "line_number": 335,
      "duration_ms": 4000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP037_B077",
      "episode_id": "EP037",
      "file_index": 76,
      "scene_id": "EP037_S04",
      "block_type": "ACTION",
      "label_raw": "ACTION",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
